# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Linfeng Zhang et al. (2021). Phase Diagram of a Deep Potential Water Model.
#   Physical Review Letters. doi:10.1103/physrevlett.126.236001  arXiv:2102.04804v3
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2102.04804v3 (sha256 71456b77b063d50b...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 668 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/zhang2021phase.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the DP model of water trained on SCAN-DFT data with
# DP-GEN concurrent learning over about 0-50 GPa and 50-2000 K (31,058
# snapshots after 36 iterations plus 3519 additional configurations), used
# to compute the phase diagram by thermodynamic integration. Test errors
# are stated only approximately, so there are no results.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
